{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52732","headline":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 七 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 北方七宿 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"壁，两星下头是霹雳。\n霹雳五星横着行，云雨次之口四方。\n壁上天廐十圆黄，鈇鑕五星羽林傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}